  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF) - : Mobile Banking Agent Project 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jimreid Consulting proposes to offer technical, vocational and entrepreneurship training to 500 disadvantaged and under-served Nigerian youths around Lagos State specifically on Agent Banking. The training will run for 3 weeks per batch for 8 batches and each certified student given a Certificate of Completion as a Mobile Banking Agent by Jimreid Consulting. Thereafter, trainees will be placed on internship with suitable organizations for further practical learning. Jimreid Consultings projects are carefully designed to help people reach their goals, through acquisition of practical vocational, technical and entrepreneurial training skills. Jimreid Consulting has successfully implemented similar projects across Nigeria and with various financial institutions including Spring Bank and FCMB/MasterCard Foundation, yielding documented results and measurable outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
